---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Greetings, fellow payments professional!</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to the omnipresent payments blog ~ OmnyPay, built by professionals for professionals (like you) and hence the ".pro" :) <a href="https://omnypay.proo">OmnyPay.Pro</a> homepage. This blog was created to address creation of the latest trends in global payments. There should be regular updates here, so, if I were you, I would bookmark this website for future reference. Passing the link around would also help. 
			</p>
			<p>
				This blog also aims to invite content from it's readers. If you have any topic in mind, do get in touch and it would be great to get your content aboard. 
			</p>
			<p>Here are a few immediate topics that will be covered in the coming weeks:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Future of Retail Payments</li>
				<li>How AI is already shaping the payments landscape?</li>
				<li>The push for sovereignity</li>
				<li>How traditional payment modes may start seeing drop in marketshare?</li>
				<li>The build vs. buy conundrum</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We hope you enjoy reading as much as we enjoy publishing! Should you have any feedback, our electronic mailboxes are only a click away! 
			</p>
			<p>
				Excited to be part of a global payments community!
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
